  {
   "id": "n-mitredetail",
   "x": 1990,
   "y": 2040,
   "w": 300,
   "page": "mitre",
   "text": "Try on this screen:\n· Open a KPI tile -> DrillDownPanel\n· Open a matrix cell -> TechniqueDrawer\n· Open a status chip -> RuleListPanel\n· Past assessment runs\n· Click anywhere outside to close the run picker\n· Legend toggle filters the matrix\n· Hide sub-techniques\n· Play advances the run timeline\n· Client confirmed — attest all 15 for Microsoft Defender for Endpoint\n· Gaps & Roadmap\n· Sort the gaps table by Technique\n· Assumptions & N/A\n· Native select — value change isn't click-simulatable, see codereview_list.py precedent\n· Search (preset query 'credential', 3+ chars) opens the drill sheet"
  },
  {
