   "text": "Try on this screen:\n· Add connection\n· Splunk\n· Cancel\n· Edit abc ltd Sentinel\n· Save changes\n· Wait for save to finish and the form to close\n· Delete Cisco CDC Splunk\n· Test\n· Pull now"
